        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "DAY SHIFT - Between the hours of 5:30 a.m. and 8:30 a.m. SWING SHIFT - Between the hours of 2:30 p.m. and 6:30 p.m. GRAVEYARD SHIFT - Between the hours of 10:30 p.m. and 1:00 a.m.",
